WEBVTT

00:03:58.350 --> 00:04:02.320
but not actually doing anything
wrong or the upstander?

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:05.890
This is the person we want to see
when we look in the mirror.

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:08.960
I've learned three things:

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:12.380
One, don't second guess yourself.

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:16.480
When you see something
amiss, ask questions,

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:20.123
because it is okay
to challenge those in authority.

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:24.160
Two, don't be complicit.

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:29.410
You always have the power to say no
in the face of wrongdoing.

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:33.040
And three, be an upstander.